{
 "about": "The hostile corpus of model replies (the reviewer's Phase 3 brief, section 8), run through ask under the group controller (group) and the ES and AT entity controllers. expect gives, per role, answered (the same answer the canonical specification gives under that role) or a code: an outcome, or a failure code of the reply. A text may hold @NEST@, expanded to nest.depth levels of nest.open, nest.inner and nest.close; expect_if_parsed applies where json.loads can parse that depth. stop_reason, when given, is the reply's; otherwise end_turn. Written by a script outside the repository; ASCII only, every other character escaped.",
